  -- claim: $\forall k\ge 1,\ r_k < \frac{1}{2^k-1} \Rightarrow r_k \le \sum_{i\ge 0}\frac{1}{2^{k+1+i}-1}$, for the greedy remainder $r$ of $\frac12$
